OL,3,ANew draft deal aims to avert collapse
OL,4,Aof talks at climate summit
OL,5,
OL,6,FTalks were set to resume at the UN
OL,7,FCOP31 summit on Sunday for a second day
OL,8,Fof overtime as countries struggled to
OL,9,Freach a new global climate deal.
OL,11,FA new draft agreement was published in
OL,12,Fthe early hours of Sunday which the
OL,13,FTurkey and Australia co-hosts hoped
OL,14,Fwould bridge the divide between
OL,15,Fnations.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
